{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_7_level_main_07-16_end","groupId":"main_7","stageId":"main_07-16","title":"愛國者之死","storyCode":"7-18","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_07-16_end.txt","sourceHash":"0bc5b8af2ca297d2bb19ddc5b52a6adaf03268e10015567822a2ea1f64f11c5a","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"核心城一角，梅菲斯特走進了石棺之間。\n激戰過後，愛國者發現了阿米婭的秘密，他回想起了古老的預言，最終倒下。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_chercen_2"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Mon3tr，撐住！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（嘶叫）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"狙擊幹員，繼續轟炸他的軀幹部分，他的鎧甲已經嚴重破損。術師，牽制住其他遊擊隊戰士，別讓他們有機會插手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（哀鳴）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"後撤，Mon3tr，近身纏鬥沒有優勢！你已經無法阻止他前進了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"劍要脫手了！他......我連直接去抓他，都控制不了他，他感受起來，就像是山崩......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"把能量聚集成束......收束。再收束，收束成線，照準他的心臟部位！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（尖嘯）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"照射。現在！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（低吼）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"這竟然也不足以破壞他的身體機能......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"怎麼會這麼膠著......！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"“每一次戰鬥都是死鬥，每次戰鬥都豁出性命，因為生命會回歸血脈，生命將在他人體內永生......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"近衛幹員，不要怠慢......撤退。他的身軀也會釋放“食人”儀式，他自身就是一個巨大的巫術裝置......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"博卓卡斯替，許多薩卡茲，並不希望你這樣的溫迪戈無謂地犧牲掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。我怎麼會，犧牲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還能動。我還能，殺死你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的身體，還能聽從，我的指揮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還沒體會盡，痛苦......不甘與遺憾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就夠了？這難道，就夠了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博卓卡斯替先生......停下吧，請你......停下吧！更多的戰鬥只是折磨！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戰士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戰士就是，要背負，所有死者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我背著，他們的痛，他們的恨，他們的沉默。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果，我，駐足......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們就是白死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"折磨？你們應該，感到折磨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們，無法戰勝我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_u"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妻子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"親愛的......別難過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妻子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您不會續弦？別這樣，親愛的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妻子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉，但您是不會認同我的這些絮叨的。您真是像石頭一樣頑固，我又有哪一次真說服過您呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妻子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您還會繼續打仗，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妻子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"答應我，博卓卡斯替，答應我。別死在戰場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妻子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我只希望您不要再受折磨。您想一想，我離去後，這裡依然有我們的家人陪伴著您，你看，小格爾......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妻子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他的睡臉，這是多麼可愛的臉蛋啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妻子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他那兩隻還沒長得很堅硬的，紅通通的小角......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妻子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是生命。是我生命的延續。孩子，是大地上所有人生命的延續。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妻子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我知道您不會吃掉我。您非常討厭溫迪戈的傳統。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妻子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但我多想永遠在您的生命裡流淌啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妻子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不過，生命......本來就不朽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妻子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您憔悴了。過度的傷感會摧毀您的，我們的孩子日後還需要您去照料，在這裡徘徊，會毀了您的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妻子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......不，博卓卡斯替。您不是一個冷血的怪物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妻子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您對我的愛是真切的。即使是我這樣只善於厭惡他人的女人，也對您傾注了同等的感情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妻子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您很驚訝......請不要驚訝。我是愛您的，就像您如此寬大又如此溫熱地愛著我一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妻子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"博卓卡斯替，我的摯愛......您未來的家人，都是我的家人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妻子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我就是這樣愛您。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"海倫。我不配得到你的愛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我沒能守住你。我也沒能，守住誓言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的家人，我全都，沒能保護。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"愛......我配不上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_chercen_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"被信賴的人，背棄了諾言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"背棄諾言的人，依然活著。即使如此，諾言，依然還在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為諾言裡，還有悔恨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不僅是，已死的人。菲林，你的悔恨，在哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要，背著，走下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這座城裡的人。烏薩斯的感染者。大地上，失去父母的人。大地上，父母做下錯事的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都會被人背負。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cherbefore_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兒子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"父親，我請求你！不要，不要再站在帝國那一邊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兒子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"命令？帝國的命令就是笑話！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兒子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，抱歉，父親......我不是在嘲諷你。不。我不會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兒子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但帝國的法令，就是為我們所有人設下的殘忍騙局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兒子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的朋友葉克多，只因為被查出是礦石病人，就被笞杖活活打死在橋上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兒子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你不是也很喜歡他的詩嗎？你不是也曾在夜晚大聲朗誦，喜極而泣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兒子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他死了！他走上了昏暗的死路，永遠離我們而去，再也不會回頭了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兒子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"作為詩人，除了文學，任何人也沒有讓他死去的資格！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兒子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"帝國的所謂感染者法令，只是一個闖入我們心中的惡徒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兒子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那種死亡，看啊，感染者的死亡，也只是讓奪走生命的人和失去生命的人都捨棄了尊嚴！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兒子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"帝國的士兵們，難道是為了這種沒有尊嚴的事領受皇帝的恩惠嗎？太荒謬了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兒子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"出身卡茲戴爾的你，和你一起長大的那些感染的薩卡茲......你也一定能理解我們烏薩斯的感染者的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兒子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你為什麼那樣無所謂？你的心腸難道也是是鐵鑄的嗎？還是說，因為你作為薩卡茲卻沒有被感染，所以你心裡連一點同情都沒有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兒子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們薩卡茲......有誰會比薩卡茲更容易感染礦石病呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兒子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，當我們中有人感染礦石病的時候，你就會知道這種罪名是多麼可笑了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兒子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也許到那時候，你才能離開你現在行走的血路，走上寬敞仁慈的大道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兒子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"父親......罷了，罷了！你可是博卓卡斯替！礦石病不會糾纏你這樣強悍的軍人，那就只能讓它爬上我的身軀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兒子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"當它盤踞在我的遺體上對你哈哈大笑的時候，你才會意識到自己的錯誤！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兒子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不要讓自己後悔，父親！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......格羅瓦茲爾，你是無辜的。你是無罪的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"感染的，是我。隱瞞的，也是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"父親終歸，有眼卻盲，父親沒能，走上正途。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我......很後悔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我真的，很後悔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我兒......父親殺了你，父親還讓你，白白死去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"父親......不配，做你的父親。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_chercen_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我停止戰鬥，就是背叛他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"越來越多......我看到......越來越多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"愛國者先生......這麼多，這麼多的悔恨......從來都不說，你從來都不向任何人去傾訴嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的悔恨，只有我能承受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Mon3tr，別靠近他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會想，為什麼，殿下那樣的人，也會遭遇不測？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不會回答我。殿下的死，至今都，撲朔迷離。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我知道。她不曾逃避。她從頭至尾，都只微笑面對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我停止戰鬥，所有的反抗，都失去意義。我停止戰鬥，就是逃避。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不可能停止。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snow_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女兒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們沒有血緣關係吧？一直叫你爸爸，還挺奇怪的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女兒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你臉色有點不太好啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女兒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"才沒有！才不是因為......因為兄弟姐妹們害怕我呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女兒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎哎，你有什麼辦法嗎，讓他們不因為你躲我躲得遠遠的辦法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女兒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有的話，叫你爸爸也可以！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女兒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊？威脅？那個詞是什麼意思啊，你還沒有教我呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女兒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉，你說哥哥學什麼東西都很快，不像我這樣只能按部就班地來......那哥哥現在在哪呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女兒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉，唉？！為什麼突然抱住我！你會凍傷的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女兒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你在哭嗎？好像有水掉在我肩上了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女兒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒有？所有人都說爸爸無血無淚，那就是說爸爸不會哭嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女兒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是爸爸明明會哭啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女兒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我前面只是亂說的，亂說的！爸爸哭，是因為凍得太疼了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女兒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸，爸爸！我不會再像剛才那麼說了，而且，我長大以後，長大以後......長大以後一定給你做一種讓你不會被凍壞的藥！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女兒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這樣你就不會再被疼哭了，對嗎？我一定會快快長大的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女兒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"家人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女兒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是說，我的兄弟姐妹們，還有你我，都是家人？不在這裡的哥哥也是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女兒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......這樣的話，爸爸，就是大家的爸爸了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女兒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我也一定會學習爸爸，幫外婆報仇，殺掉那些欺負我們的人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女兒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不准這麼說？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女兒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼！明明爸爸每天都在殺那些壞人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女兒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......什麼叫不想我成為爸爸這樣的人？爸爸難道不是好人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女兒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼爸爸也是壞人？！我不懂，你說明白！爸爸怎麼會是壞人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女兒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我討厭爸爸。討厭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女兒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......不學爸爸，就能到城裡去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女兒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸......你說，我們真的能到城裡去嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女兒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你說的什麼手指糖.....真的好吃嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女兒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果要不當爸爸這樣的人才能吃到的話......唔......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女兒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女兒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女兒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我想，不管怎麼樣，好人和壞人，我都可以當的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女兒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只要永遠和爸爸，還有兄弟姐妹們一起......一直在一起就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女兒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸是我的家人。我知道的，爸爸是我最好的家人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女兒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"當然啦，第二是......第三是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"葉蓮娜......葉蓮娜......我的女兒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的女兒......父親，什麼，都沒能，為你做到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我什麼，都沒做到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我虧欠你，太多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"太多。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_chercen_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"太多了，太多了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡特斯女孩。你是，羅德島的領袖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你究竟，哪裡出眾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們有個成員，向我描述過你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們的戰士，十分優秀。但僅僅優秀，還是會死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還有哪裡，能讓我，看到價值？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想阻止，核心城，卻無法，戰勝我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"別想碰阿米婭！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"一把，兩把，三把......第四把！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"盾，碎了。\n戟，斷了。\n巨大的怪物，沒有停下腳步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"竟然能，釘穿鎧甲。這副鎧甲，終於到了極限。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"......你掙脫不了的......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菲林，你很強大。你對我是威脅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，愛國者先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我離你，只有十步。不用再等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你已經到極限了，我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"因為你畢竟不像霜星小姐，你並不是個術師......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"那這一下就已經足夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"這個法術裡有......我看到的所有事情。我在你身上看到的所有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......已經夠了，愛國者先生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"已經夠了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"居然......這是......什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這一擊，很精準。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已，不再能挪步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......所有損傷，堆砌到了極限。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"博卓卡斯替......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我本打算，擊潰你們，之後讓遊擊隊，假借你們名義，殺死塔露拉。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（現在，已經不必。你們勝了，你們名正言順。去殺死，塔露拉。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（愛國者......先生？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我怎麼能允許，感染者，被奴役他人者，利用？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我的命，你們拿去用。這是勝者的，戰利品。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們，勝了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"勳爵，這個，請拿好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"——這是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停下切城的密鑰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你們，去艦橋區......你們要帶上它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"愛國者先生，你......只為了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的確打算，殺了你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但現在，你們戰勝了我。你們應得。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"為什麼要做到這一步？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為我不信你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只相信，戰爭的結果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我女兒，只是天真，她會網開一面，也會假設結局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會。我只等到結果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，最好的結果......就是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的士兵，因為驚訝，沒能發揮全力。他們活著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有我一人......為之而死。我死得其所。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......怎麼回事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可露希爾，生物處理室13號艙，給我圖表！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"艙室的內部溫度急劇升高！能量在外放！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等等，它的形態在轉化！經過十四小時的處理，為什麼還會進入到這一階段？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"PRTS，剛才是誰使用了這個艙位？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}？我們在龍門攻防戰裡有幹員傷亡嗎？這處理的是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你慢點說，你說Dr.{@nickname}在艙位裡安置了誰？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_chercen_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"勳爵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我在聽，博卓卡斯替。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們溫迪戈，自我流放，失去一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我們身負，薩卡茲的傳統。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先祖，塑造我，培育我，注視我。所以，請替我見證。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"博卓卡斯替......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不知道自己夠不夠格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我認為你是，最好人選。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"“......我在此擔當一位薩卡茲的見證者。博卓卡斯替，卡茲戴爾的溫迪戈，一生從未背叛過血肉，也從未愧對親族。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"“他將把一生留在光芒下的身體裡......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"“......而他的精魂，則將回到溫迪戈溫熱的血脈中去。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"這是個詛咒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對我，並不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——我感到......我感到，我清晰的視野，開始模糊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你，勳爵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我以為你討厭這些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我，已經老了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_perimeter"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡是哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，原來是這樣。哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉真的背叛我們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"你以為我們會坐以待斃嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"你們不是對手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"有來世的話，向我報仇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"就因為知道會死，所以就要放棄了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"就這樣被你們無故殺了而——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"別殺他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"讓他們走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"梅菲斯特......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"魔族人，我會給你們不知疼痛的身軀。讓他們走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"我們比你的牧群強大得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以把我的生命拿出來和你們分享，你們能真正地永遠戰鬥，不知疲倦地戰鬥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"......可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"但他們要出去，也必須由我的同伴看著。現在還不能違背塔露拉的命令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"你們，弩手。出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"梅菲斯特？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"（為什麼他會救我們......？難道塔露拉還有什麼陰謀？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，你為什麼特意要到這裡來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"......因為我想進去這裡。我想知道這裡有什麼樣的秘密。我想知道羅德島究竟為什麼會從這裡帶走一個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"因為我從錄影裡看到那個人從這裡出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"梅菲斯特......？為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"你們，想聽歌嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，浮士德隊長他說，他說......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，是的。我已經不會唱了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，但我可以試試。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"應該是首搖籃曲吧？不記得是有誰教過我這首曲子......我不記得了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"只是有人在我的夢裡，一直地哼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"沉睡吧，沉睡吧♪\n刺蝟玩偶與小熊們......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_chercen_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烏薩斯的，感染者，又要走去哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"晦暗的夜晚，還會遮蔽......多少明星？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"......大尉，大尉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最後的命令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"大尉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戰鬥下去。活下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們的路，只有你們......自己去走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走了，才有路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我必定要死。只是不知道，是否該是現在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的死，究竟能，改變什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許這個問題，你們，才能回答。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"沉進靜靜的黑色......\n哥哥，姐姐，妹妹，弟弟，夢鄉啊夢鄉，蓋住了他們的身體......♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_building_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"“小姐”？怎麼在這哭......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"誰哭了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好。不過，這可是近衛局大樓門口啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"讓別人看到你哭，真就好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"反正......反正也沒有別人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣好了，我坐你前面的台階上吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我個子大，擋住你，就沒人看得見了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"你在做什麼啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。就是因為沒做好，才覺得不太爽吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"Missy，我們兩個算是都失敗了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"我才不管......不管她去哪！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，是。我知道啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，不要打我。是不是我無論怎麼回答都會被打啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"終於......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我......這一生......得以結束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"海倫......格羅瓦茲爾......葉蓮娜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是你們......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我終於......能夠回家......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"不。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"——不。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幻覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會......我，不要幻覺，不要慰藉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是誰......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是誰引我看到......幻覺！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_chercen_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......為什麼......為什麼愛國者先生會......掙脫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來，如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——是你。卡特斯。是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來，你就是......繼承者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特雷西斯，說謊。殿下她......有繼承人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是魔王。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我死在......魔王的手上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......怎麼會？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我終歸，沒逃過命運。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭？！你不可以......？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"對，對不起！但，但凱爾希醫生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽說，過去，薩卡茲的君主，將願景與撫慰，作為賞賜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們的功臣，能見宏偉高牆，或是已逝摯愛——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無數戰士，為此幻境，奮戰不息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是，我只是......愛國者先生，我不想......不想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......你生命的最後......明明不該這樣淒慘！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到......我看到了，我看到你兩百多年......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不斷地戰鬥......不斷地戰鬥，失去，失去......失去了一切......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想......我不想這就是你的......結局！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的，結局？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我本想讓你有個......更好的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的結局，怎麼能由，別人給予！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幻覺？不！那不是結局！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果悲慘，那就悲慘。如果愚蠢，那就愚蠢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是，我的結局。是我......應得結局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我活過，反抗過，失敗過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已經，夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼，為什麼......為什麼就夠了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有人該這樣失去一切！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你還是個，小孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是什麼孩子！我已經戰鬥了無數次！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好結局，從不理所應當。孩子，才相信童謠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你和我的女兒，都只是，相信童謠的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說霜星那些，太重了......太重了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不同意，她的觀點。她只是......年幼的孩子。只是，年幼的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"礦石病，奴隸主，這片大地......竟容不得，一個孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉送她，去死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"那為什麼我們不能一同去對抗塔露拉——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能，帶給我什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉，曾經帶給我的，你甚至還，做不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之後，你又會，變成什麼樣子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是命運。我嘗到，太多滋味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我決不向命運，低頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使命運，每次都賜我，相同結局......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也寧可，每日與它纏鬥，直至太陽，再次升起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......你也許能改變。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我與命運抗爭，無數年......終歸，還是，沒能勝過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你......你也許，不同......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真有資格，繼承那位殿下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真有能力，活著離開這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真有膽識，踏進無邊荒原？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我一個人是不可能的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但是我不是一個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這一切......都屬於你們。只有你們......去做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個......整合運動的，暴君，命運......你們自己......去推翻。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"等等。\n不對。\n凱爾希抬眼望向陰沉的天空。\n我在哪裡見過這些？\n難道說......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭......阿米婭......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲的預言來自種群記憶的全面融合。源石多生區域發生的源石能量爆發......核心城恰好遭遇了天災。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"祭壇......阿米婭......溫迪戈......魔王？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，如果這能直接影響到......不可能！古老的溫迪戈最後的血脈直接貫通了薩卡茲的整支族群嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"這個預言......這個預言？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"雪？“食人”的博卓卡斯替和所有祭壇發生了共鳴？！還有我剛才施加的......溫迪戈的回魂......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"各位幹員！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"無論他說什麼......無論博卓卡斯替說了些什麼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"【一個字也不要信！】"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"溫迪戈忽然開口，沙啞的聲音似乎傳遍了整個中央區。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我見諸城，滿目瘡痍。\n我見源石，遍佈大地。\n我見你，頭頂黑冠，將千萬生靈，熬成回憶。\n我見魔王，將所有種群，盡數奴役。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......什......麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不可能......不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"愛國者！預言是不可信的！那只是源石技藝的生理性殘留！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但......但我知曉......所有預言......全都實現。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也正死在，魔王之手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......勳爵。不。勳爵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"博卓卡斯替！！你不是用一生反抗了命運嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"年幼的，魔王......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你，你......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"會是大地上最恐怖的災難。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她必須死！\n否則，這片大地就會死去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不能讓你，活在世上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛國者","speakerId":"avg_npc_025_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你大可恨我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"鎧甲的碰撞聲傳入你的耳中。\n已經渾身碎裂的怪物，突然向阿米婭伸出了手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"——阿米婭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小，小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_7_13"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_7_14"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_7_15"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡特斯女孩沒有閃躲。死亡的陰影襲上了她被硝煙染黑的面龐，她沒有挪步，沒有驚叫，僅僅是直視著愛國者的雙眼。\n如同想要望進他的靈魂。\n於此同時，沉重的黑色利劍與閃爍著不詳光芒的能量束，飛速地刺入了巨人那具不死之軀，卻也依然沒能撼動他分毫。\n就在愛國者即將捏碎黑衣女孩的頭顱時......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_7_16"},{"type":"narration","text":"溫迪戈的動作，戛然而止。\n似乎有什麼從他頭盔中悄然滴落。\n......\n一分鐘過去了。\n在這漫長的一分鐘裡，除了移動城市的隆隆聲外，你什麼也聽不見。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_7_17"},{"type":"narration","text":"你意識到，面前的怪物已經死了。\n一步也不曾後退。一秒也沒有放棄。即使如此，死亡還是停下了他一生的行軍。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凱爾希"]},{"speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","aliases":["星熊"]},{"speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","aliases":["梅菲斯特"]},{"speakerId":"char_308_swire","aliases":["詩懷雅"]}]}
